[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3519357891","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112653#issuecomment-3519357891","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112653","id":3519357891,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7RxSPD","user":{"login":"mrjustaguy","id":50302479,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMzAyNDc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50302479?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy","html_url":"https://github.com/mrjustaguy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-12T00:49:36Z","updated_at":"2025-11-12T00:55:30Z","body":"I concur.\n\nAlso some of the changes don't seem to get reverted when moving to the Classic theme and Godot 3 colors, like the font is different (and IMO a Substantial Downgrade in most regards, although not all, like the lowercase L is better, but several other letters are worse, like G, C, c and a are a little harder to read) \n\nThe only change I've observed that I like is the increased Contrast and slight compactification of the UI\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3519357891/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3520669148","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112653#issuecomment-3520669148","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112653","id":3520669148,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7R2SXc","user":{"login":"ryevdokimov","id":105675984,"node_id":"U_kgDOBkx80A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105675984?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov","html_url":"https://github.com/ryevdokimov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-12T08:36:31Z","updated_at":"2025-11-12T08:36:31Z","body":"I get the appeal of the original look; it's inviting and comforting, but I don't think majority of the demographic of people using Godot prefer it over alternatives due to its original aesthetic but rather its intuitive workflow and open-source nature.\n\nIn my opinion as the adoption of Godot grows it makes sense to pivot to a more professional utilitarian look as the grey helps with white balance perception, keeps the focus on the viewport, and the developers involved with this change have improved many other different aspects of UI, so I support them. At the end of the day Godot is a tool, still completely customizable, and I believe this change with help with greater adoption (everyone benefits from this). \n\nI agree it's not perfect at the moment, but I've seen a string of PRs and issues that aiming to address some of these things, and it seems like majority of people prefer this change. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3520669148/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":1,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3522188169","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112653#issuecomment-3522188169","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112653","id":3522188169,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7R8FOJ","user":{"login":"davthedev","id":26961646,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2OTYxNjQ2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26961646?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davthedev","html_url":"https://github.com/davthedev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davthedev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davthedev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davthedev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davthedev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davthedev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davthedev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davthedev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davthedev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davthedev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-12T14:19:47Z","updated_at":"2025-11-12T14:19:47Z","body":"The new theme may not be pleasing to all but consider this:\n\n- It is still a work in progress. If something's not right, make a specific issue for it. The community needs our input to improve the theme.\n- The classic theme is still available as you have seen.\n- If you enjoyed the previous font better, there is a setting to put it back\n\nI also agree that there are downgrades with the new theme but those can be adressed as we help signaling what can be improved. For example, I also find the new font a little less readable on a 1080p 27-inch display (the type of pixel pitch where the grid is still perceptible), some interaction feedback has disappeared (missing hover & press effects), and some items are blurry in that resolution. I already made tickets for some of those points.\n\nThe community has decided to move forward with it. I'm good with that, as long as there is still a way to use the classic theme and other custom themes. This opportunity is also uncovering a lot of UI bugs that were unnoticed so far.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3522188169/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":1,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3522294637","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112653#issuecomment-3522294637","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112653","id":3522294637,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7R8fNt","user":{"login":"mrjustaguy","id":50302479,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMzAyNDc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50302479?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy","html_url":"https://github.com/mrjustaguy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://ap